<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8">
 <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
 <title>APAC SC Project Management Hub & Collaboration Desk</title>
 <!-- Tailwind CSS Engine -->
 <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
 <!-- Plus Jakarta Sans Premium Font -->
 <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
 <style>
 body {
 font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
 scroll-behavior: smooth;
 background: radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, #f8fafc 0%, #f1f5f9 50%, #e2e8f0 100%);
 }
 
.liquid-glass {
 background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
 backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(190%);
 -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(190%);
 border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
 box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(31, 38, 135, 0.03),
 inset 0 1px 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
 }

 .liquid-glass-dark {
 background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
 backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%);
 -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%);
 border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
 box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
 }

 .liquid-glass-card {
 background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
 backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
 -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
 border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
 box-shadow: 0 4px 16px 0 rgba(31, 38, 135, 0.02),
 inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
 transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
 }

 .liquid-glass-card:hover {
 background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
 transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.005);
 box-shadow: 0 16px 36px -4px rgba(31, 38, 135, 0.06),
 0 4px 16px -2px rgba(31, 38, 135, 0.03);
 border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
 }

 .scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar {
 width: 6px;
 height: 6px;
 }
 .scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
 background: transparent;
 }
 .scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
 background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
 border-radius: 99px;
 }
 .scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
 background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.25);
 }

 .card-active {
 box-shadow: 0 0 0 2.5px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95), 0 12px 28px -4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.15);
 background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);
 transform: translateY(-1px);
 border-color: transparent !important;
 }

 .drag-over-cell {
 background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06) !important;
 border-left: 2.5px dashed rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4) !important;
 transition: all 0.15s ease;
 }
 .drag-over-header {
 border-left: 3.5px solid #0f172a !important;
 background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6) !important;
 }
 .dragging-active {
 opacity: 0.25;
 transform: scale(0.96);
 }
 .dragging-quarter, .dragging-tower {
 opacity: 0.45;
 background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
 }

 [contenteditable="true"] {
 outline: none;
 transition: all 0.2s ease;
 }
 [contenteditable="true"]:hover {
 background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
 border-radius: 4px;
 cursor: pointer;
 }
 [contenteditable="true"]:focus {
 background-color: #ffffff;
 box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #000000;
 border-radius: 6px;
 padding: 2px 4px;
 cursor: text;
 }

 .view-transition {
 transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), 
opacity 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
 }
 
.view-hidden {
 opacity: 0;
 transform: scale(0.97) translateY(12px);
 pointer-events: none;
 position: absolute;
 width: 100%;
 height: 0;
 overflow: hidden;
 }
 
.view-visible {
 opacity: 1;
 transform: scale(1) translateY(0);
 pointer-events: auto;
 position: relative;
 height: auto;
 }

 #detailSection {
 transition: width 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), 
opacity 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), 
transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
 }
 #timelineSection {
 transition: width 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
 }

 .modal-bounce {
 transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), 
opacity 0.3s ease-out;
 }

 @keyframes pulse-ring {
 0% { transform: scale(0.96); opacity: 1; }
 50% { transform: scale(1.08); opacity: 0.4; }
 100% { transform: scale(0.96); opacity: 1; }
 }
 .pulse-accent {
 animation: pulse-ring 2s infinite ease-in-out;
 }

 @keyframes fadeIn {
 from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
 to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
 }
 .animate-fade-in {
 animation: fadeIn 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
 }
 </style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-900 min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased xl:h-screen xl:overflow-hidden selection:bg-black selection:text-white relative">

 <!-- Collaborator Identity Overlay -->
 <div id="loginOverlay" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-md z-[100] flex items-center justify-center p-4">
 <div class="bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl max-w-md w-full p-8 shadow-2xl border border-white flex flex-col items-center text-center">
 <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-950 text-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 text-2xl font-extrabold shadow-lg">
 SC
 </div>
 <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-2 font-sans">Collaborator Identity Registration</h2>
 <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-6 leading-relaxed font-sans px-4">To ensure real-time collaboration updates, audit tracking, and version history tracing, please register your name before entering the workspace.</p>
 
<div class="w-full bg-slate-100 p-1.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/60 mb-5">
 <input type="text" id="userInputName" onkeydown="handleLoginKeyDown(event)" placeholder="e.g., Yvonne Yin / David" class="w-full text-center text-sm bg-transparent outline-none py-2.5 font-bold text-slate-800">
 </div>

 <button onclick="submitUserLogin()" class="w-full bg-black hover:bg-slate-800 text-white py-3.5 rounded-2xl text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase transition-all shadow-md">
 Enter Collaboration Hub
 </button>
 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- Toast Notification Banner -->
 <div id="toastMessage" class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-50 transform translate-y-20 opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-all duration-300 ease-out bg-slate-900/95 backdrop-blur-md text-white px-5 py-3.5 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl flex items-center gap-3">
 <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
 <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
 </svg>
 <span id="toastText" class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide"></span>
 </div>

 <!-- Confirmation Modal Dialog -->
 <div id="customConfirmModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-sm hidden items-center justify-center z-50 p-4 transition-all duration-300">
 <div class="bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl max-w-sm w-full p-6 shadow-2xl border border-white transform scale-90 opacity-0 modal-bounce" id="confirmModalBox">
 <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-rose-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-rose-500">
 <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
 <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 7l-.867 12.142A2 2 0 0116.138 21H7.862a2 2 0 01-1.995-1.858L5 7m5 4v6m4-6v6m1-10V4a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 00-1 1v3M4 7h16"></path>
 </svg>
 </div>
 <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1.5" id="confirmTitle">Confirm Action</h3>
 <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-5 leading-relaxed" id="confirmDescription">This action cannot be undone. Are you sure you want to proceed?</p>
 <div class="flex gap-2.5">
 <button id="confirmCancelBtn" class="flex-1 py-2 text-xs font-bold rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 transition-all font-sans">Cancel</button>
 <button id="confirmProceedBtn" class="flex-1 py-2 text-xs font-bold rounded-xl bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-700 text-white transition-all shadow-sm font-sans">Proceed</button>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- ========================================================== -->
 <!-- SECTION A: Main Portfolio Dashboard Hub -->
 <!-- ========================================================== -->
 <div id="hubView" class="view-transition view-visible flex-1 flex flex-col min-h-0 overflow-y-auto scrollbar-thin p-6 max-w-[1800px] w-full mx-auto space-y-6">
 
<header class="liquid-glass rounded-3xl p-6 space-y-6 shadow-sm shrink-0">
 <div class="flex flex-col xl:flex-row justify-between items-start xl:items-center gap-4">
 <div>
 <h1 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-none">APAC Supply Chain Project Management Hub</h1>
 <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mt-2.5 leading-none">Collaborative Operations & Scheduling Desk</p>
 
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-4 flex-wrap bg-white/50 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/50 max-w-xl shadow-inner">
 <span class="flex h-2 w-2 relative">
 <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
 <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500"></span>
 </span>
 <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">Sync Connection Status:</span>
 <span id="activeCollaboratorsList" class="text-[10px] text-slate-800 font-bold">Connecting to live database...</span>
 </div>
 </div>
 
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 select-none self-end xl:self-auto">
 <button onclick="toggleActivityDrawer()" class="px-3.5 py-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white text-xs font-extrabold rounded-xl shadow-md transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5" title="View live updates and audit logs stream">
 <span>⚡ Activity Feed</span>
 <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
 </button>
 <button onclick="exportPortfolioData()" class="px-3.5 py-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-xs font-extrabold rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5" title="Export entire portfolio structure into a JSON file">
 <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"></path></svg>
 <span>Export Data</span>
 </button>
 <button onclick="triggerImportPortfolioData()" class="px-3.5 py-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-xs font-extrabold rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5" title="Import JSON portfolio backup file">
 <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-8l-4-4m0 0L8 8m4-4v12"></path></svg>
 <span>Import Data</span>
 </button>
 <input type="file" id="importPortfolioInput" class="hidden" accept=".json" onchange="importPortfolioData(event)">
 </div>
 </div>

 <div class="border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-4 space-y-3">
 <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
 <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest font-sans">Task Status Tracking Center (Status Center)</span>
 <span class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 font-bold font-sans">Tip: Click any metrics card to filter and view the combined cross-workspace roadmap timeline matrix.</span>
 </div>
 
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
 <button onclick="toggleGlobalStatusFilter('All')" id="trackBtn-All" class="p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/70 hover:bg-white border border-slate-200 flex flex-col items-center justify-center transition-all shadow-sm font-sans">
 <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 mb-1.5"></span>
 <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-400 font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest font-sans">Total Portfolio</span>
 <span id="aggregated-All" class="text-base font-black text-slate-900 mt-1">0</span>
 </button>
 <button onclick="toggleGlobalStatusFilter('Done')" id="trackBtn-Done" class="p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/70 hover:bg-white border border-slate-200 flex flex-col items-center justify-center transition-all shadow-sm font-sans">
 <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 mb-1.5"></span>
 <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-400 font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest font-sans">Done</span>
 <span id="aggregated-Done" class="text-base font-black text-slate-900 mt-1">0</span>
 </button>
 <button onclick="toggleGlobalStatusFilter('WIP')" id="trackBtn-WIP" class="p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/70 hover:bg-white border border-slate-200 flex flex-col items-center justify-center transition-all shadow-sm font-sans">
 <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500 mb-1.5"></span>
 <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-400 font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">WIP</span>
 <span id="aggregated-WIP" class="text-base font-black text-slate-900 mt-1">0</span>
 </button>
 <button onclick="toggleGlobalStatusFilter('Not started')" id="trackBtn-Not_started" class="p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/70 hover:bg-white border border-slate-200 flex flex-col items-center justify-center transition-all shadow-sm font-sans">
 <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500 mb-1.5"></span>
 <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-400 font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest font-sans">Not started</span>
 <span id="aggregated-Not_started" class="text-base font-black text-slate-900 mt-1">0</span>
 </button>
 </div>
 </div>
 </header>

 <!-- Global Status Filters Overview Matrix -->
 <div id="globalStatusFilterView" class="hidden space-y-4 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/50">
 <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
 <div>
 <span class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-sans">Global Portfolio Filter Active...</span>
 <span id="currentGlobalFilterLabel" class="text-xs font-black text-slate-800 font-sans block mt-1"></span>
 </div>
 <button onclick="closeGlobalStatusFilter()" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-black text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl transition-all font-sans">Close Panel</button>
 </div>
 
<div class="overflow-x-auto scrollbar-thin rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-200/30">
 <div id="globalStatusFilterMatrix" class="min-w-[1200px] divide-y divide-slate-300"></div>
 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- Strategic Workspace Cards -->
 <div class="space-y-4 min-h-0">
 <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
 <h2 class="text-xs font-black tracking-widest text-slate-500 uppercase font-sans">Strategic Workspaces</h2>
 <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold font-sans">Tip: Click any workspace card to open its interactive timeline Gantt chart.</span>
 </div>
 <div id="workspaceGrid" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"></div>
 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- ========================================================== -->
 <!-- SECTION B: Strategic Workspace Gantt Roadmap Canvas -->
 <!-- ========================================================== -->
 <div id="workspaceView" class="view-transition view-hidden flex-1 flex-col min-h-0">
 
<header class="liquid-glass border-b border-white/40 px-6 py-3.5 shrink-0 shadow-sm flex flex-col xl:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 z-40">
 <div class="flex items-center gap-4 w-full xl:w-auto">
 <button onclick="returnToHub()" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold text-slate-700 hover:text-black transition-all bg-white hover:bg-slate-200 border border-slate-200/60 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl shadow-sm shrink-0 font-sans">
 <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
 <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path>
 </svg>
 <span>Return</span>
 </button>
 <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
 <h1 id="headerMainTitle" contenteditable="true" onblur="handleHeaderEdit('name', this.innerText)" class="text-sm md:text-base font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-none truncate font-sans">Loading Workspace...</h1>
 <p id="headerSubtitle" contenteditable="true" onblur="handleHeaderEdit('subtitle', this.innerText)" class="text-[9px] text-slate-500 font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mt-1 leading-none truncate font-sans">Loading subtitle...</p>
 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- Status filter pills -->
 <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-1.5 bg-white/40 p-1 rounded-1.5xl border border-white/50 w-full xl:w-auto select-none">
 <div id="pill-all" onclick="filterStatus('all')" class="metric-filter-pill cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-white/70 hover:bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-white/80 transition-all">
 <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900"></span>
 <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">All:</span>
 <span class="text-[10px] font-black text-slate-900 font-sans" id="statAll">0</span>
 </div>
 <div id="pill-Done" onclick="filterStatus('Done')" class="metric-filter-pill cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-white/70 hover:bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-white/80 transition-all">
 <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
 <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">Done:</span>
 <span class="text-[10px] font-black text-emerald-600 font-sans" id="statDone">0</span>
 </div>
 <div id="pill-WIP" onclick="filterStatus('WIP')" class="metric-filter-pill cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-white/70 hover:bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-white/80 transition-all">
 <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500"></span>
 <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">WIP:</span>
 <span class="text-[10px] font-black text-orange-600 font-sans" id="statWIP">0</span>
 </div>
 <div id="pill-Not_started" onclick="filterStatus('Not started')" class="metric-filter-pill cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-white/70 hover:bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-white/80 transition-all">
 <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500"></span>
 <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">Not Started:</span>
 <span class="text-[10px] font-black text-sky-600 font-sans" id="statNot_started">0</span>
 </div>
 </div>
 
<!-- History actions and search bar -->
 <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-end gap-2 w-full xl:w-auto shrink-0">
 <div class="flex items-center gap-1 bg-white/30 p-1 rounded-xl border border-white/40 font-sans">
 <button onclick="triggerUndo()" id="btnUndo" disabled class="p-1.5 bg-white/80 hover:bg-white text-slate-800 disabled:opacity-30 disabled:hover:bg-white/80 disabled:text-slate-400 rounded-lg shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center transition-all" title="Undo Last Change">
 <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
 <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 15L3 9m0 0l6-6M3 9h12a6 6 0 010 12h-3"></path>
 </svg>
 </button>
 <button onclick="triggerRedo()" id="btnRedo" disabled class="p-1.5 bg-white/80 hover:bg-white text-slate-800 disabled:opacity-30 disabled:hover:bg-white/80 disabled:text-slate-400 rounded-lg shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center transition-all" title="Redo Last Action">
 <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
 <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 15l6-6m0 0l-6-6m6 6H9a6 6 0 000 12h3"></path>
 </svg>
 </button>
 </div>

 <div class="relative w-full sm:w-44">
 <input type="text" id="searchInput" class="w-full pl-8 pr-7 py-1.5 text-xs bg-white/55 border border-white/60 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-black focus:bg-white focus:border-transparent transition-all outline-none text-slate-800 font-medium placeholder:text-slate-400 font-sans" placeholder="Search projects or leads...">
 <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400 absolute left-2.5 top-2.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
 <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path>
 </svg>
 <button onclick="clearSearch()" id="btnClearSearch" class="hidden absolute right-2 top-2 p-0.5 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 transition-all">
 <svg class="w-2.5 h-2.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
 </button>
 </div>
 </div>
 </header>

 <!-- Main Workspace Timeline Grid -->
 <main class="flex-1 max-w-[1800px] w-full mx-auto p-4 xl:p-5 flex gap-5 xl:h-[calc(100vh-68px)] xl:overflow-hidden relative">
 
<section id="timelineSection" class="w-full h-full flex flex-col gap-4 xl:overflow-y-auto scrollbar-thin pr-1 pb-4">
 
<div id="lblInstructions" contenteditable="true" onblur="handleHeaderEdit('instructions', this.innerText)" class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold bg-white/40 border border-white/50 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl leading-snug text-left select-none shadow-sm transition-all font-sans animate-fade-in">
 Double-click any empty grid cell to quickly create and schedule a project card! Double-click any column header to rename or delete. Drag cards, headers, or lanes to customize your layout.
 </div>

 <!-- Strategic Gantt Board Container -->
 <div class="liquid-glass rounded-3xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col flex-1 min-h-0">
 <div class="bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur-md text-white px-5 py-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 select-none shrink-0 border-b border-white/10">
 <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
 <span>📅</span>
 <h2 id="sectUnifiedTitle" contenteditable="true" onblur="handleHeaderEdit('sectTitle', this.innerText)" class="text-xs font-extrabold tracking-tight uppercase rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 select-none font-sans">APAC Supply Chain Gantt Roadmap Matrix</h2>
 </div>
 
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-sans">
 <span class="bg-white/20 text-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[9px] font-bold" id="badgeCountUnified">0 Projects Scheduled</span>
